    "answer": {
      "short": "$(4-5x)(2x+3)$",
      "worked": "The quadratic term is $(-5x)(2x)=-10x^2$, the cross terms are $8x-15x=-7x$, and $4\\times3=12$.\n$$12-7x-10x^2=(4-5x)(2x+3).$$",
